{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-rag-cost","title":"成本与维护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/practice/graph-rag-cost","wordCount":1732,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本与维护\">成本与维护</h1><p>GraphRAG 的技术魅力很容易让人忽略一个朴素事实：它可能贵到上不起。Microsoft 原始方案索引一份大型企业语料的报道成本常在 <strong>$33,000 量级</strong>——这不是延迟、不是复杂度，是一张真金白银的账单，足以让一个 POC 在财务评审上当场夭折。理解这笔账从哪来、能砍到多低、上线后还要持续花多少，是判断 GraphRAG 该不该上的硬约束。这一篇把成本结构、降本路线和长期维护一次说清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>成本是判断 GraphRAG 该不该上的硬约束，概念清单如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成本结构</strong>：几乎全在离线索引的 LLM 调用，抽取（随语料线性）与社区摘要（每社区每层一次）是两大头，消歧相对小。</li>\n<li><strong>总账公式</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Total</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>query</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Total} = C_{\\text{index}} + N_{\\text{query}} \\cdot C_{\\text{query}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">query</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：所有降本手段都在动这个式子的某一项。</li>\n<li><strong>降本即砍项</strong>：LazyGraphRAG 延迟摘要（索引至 0.1%）、LightRAG 绕过社区结构（约 1/6000 且可增量）、HippoRAG 压多跳、PathRAG 压 context——但成本多是后移而非消失。</li>\n<li><strong>增量维护</strong>：被低估的长期成本；原始 GraphRAG 高频更新近乎被迫全量重建，LightRAG 局部增量是其在变动语料里更实用的根因。</li>\n<li><strong>省钱别伤质量</strong>：缓存与复用是「不伤质量的免费午餐」，应优先于「砍 gleaning、换小模型」这类有副作用的手段；最终要和评测出的质量提升对账。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;原始 GraphRAG · $33k&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;砍哪一项&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;社区摘要 → LazyGraphRAG&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;社区结构 → LightRAG&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;多跳 → HippoRAG&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F[&quot;context → PathRAG&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;索引成本 ≈ 向量 RAG&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"原始 GraphRAG · $33k\"] --&gt; B{\"砍哪一项\"}\n  B --&gt; C[\"社区摘要 → LazyGraphRAG\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"社区结构 → LightRAG\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"多跳 → HippoRAG\"]\n  B --&gt; F[\"context → PathRAG\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"索引成本 ≈ 向量 RAG\"]</pre><h2 id=\"成本从哪来-一张索引账单的解剖\">成本从哪来：一张索引账单的解剖</h2><p>GraphRAG 的成本几乎全在<strong>离线索引的 LLM 调用</strong>上，分三块，前两块是大头：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>index</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>chunk</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>extract</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>抽取</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>community</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>summary</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>社区摘要</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>resolve</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>消歧</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{index}} \\approx \\underbrace{N_{\\text{chunk}}(1+g) \\cdot c_{\\text{extract}}}_{\\text{抽取}} + \\underbrace{N_{\\text{community}} \\cdot L \\cdot c_{\\text{summary}}}_{\\text{社区摘要}} + \\underbrace{c_{\\text{resolve}}}_{\\text{消歧}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">抽取</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"to